# CST Studio auto-generates a same-named results/cache folder next to every
# .cst project file (Model/, ModelCache/, Result/, Export/, ...). These are
# regenerable from the .cst file itself and are large (tens to hundreds of MB)
# - never commit them. Add new entries here as new .cst projects are created.
sphere_DR/
start (1)/
power-combining/eigenmode_bare_sphere/
power-combining/eigenmode_seated_sphere/
power-combining/single_probe_baseline/

# Claude Code runtime state (not project config)
.claude/
